[LINK: (533) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/533]  – Mercurius, a Roman priest, was elected  [LINK: (Pope John II) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_John_II] ; he was likely the first pope to  [LINK: (adopt a new name upon elevation to the papacy) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Papal_name] .

[LINK: (1680) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1680]  –  [LINK: (Trunajaya rebellion) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trunajaya_rebellion] :  [LINK: (Amangkurat II of Mataram) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amangkurat_II_of_Mataram]  of  [LINK: (Java) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Java]  and his courtiers stabbed  [LINK: (Trunajaya) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trunajaya]  to death a week after the rebel leader surrendered to  [LINK: (VOC) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dutch_East_India_Company]  forces.

[LINK: (1941) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1941]  –  [LINK: (Second World War) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_II] :  [LINK: (Llandaff Cathedral) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Llandaff_Cathedral]  (pictured) in  [LINK: (Cardiff) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cardiff] , Wales, was severely damaged by German bombing during the  [LINK: (Cardiff Blitz) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cardiff_Blitz] .

[LINK: (1976) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1976]  –  [LINK: (An extratropical cyclone) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gale_of_January_1976]  began affecting parts of western Europe, resulting in coastal flooding around the southern portions of the  [LINK: (North Sea) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Sea]  and leading to at least 82 deaths.

[LINK: (2024) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024]  – While landing at  [LINK: (Haneda Airport) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haneda_Airport] ,  [LINK: (Japan Airlines) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japan_Airlines]  Flight 516  [LINK: (collided) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_Haneda_Airport_runway_collision]  with a  [LINK: (De Havilland Canada Dash 8) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/De_Havilland_Canada_Dash_8]  which killed five people in total.

