[LINK: (1911) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1911]  –  [LINK: (A gun battle) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siege_of_Sidney_Street]  in the  [LINK: (East End of London) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_End_of_London]  left two dead and sparked a political row over the operational involvement of  [LINK: (Winston Churchill) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Winston_Churchill] , then  [LINK: (Home Secretary) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Home_Secretary] .

