[LINK: (1975) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1975]  – The bulk carrier  [LINK: (Lake Illawarra) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SS_Lake_Illawarra]  struck a bridge over the  [LINK: (River Derwent) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/River_Derwent_(Tasmania)]  in  [LINK: (Hobart) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hobart] , Australia,  [LINK: (causing the deaths) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tasman_Bridge_disaster]  of seven of the ship's crewmen and five motorists on the bridge.

